        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana MM2008, Stainless Steel MM Series Hand Towel Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 10 inch Towel Rod was designed with the modern home in mind. It is available in several contemporary finish color options. The Stainless Steel MM Series Hand Towel Holder comes packaged with the mounting hardware. The sleek, angular design is perfect for adding a modern update to your bathroom. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana MM Series\"><b>Deltana MM Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the MM Series 10 Inch Towel Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Arm Length: 9-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 10-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Length: 2-3/16\" square</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MM2008-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262429\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana MM2008 Towel Rod Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 towel bar, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
